#: ../../source/docs/common-ppm-encoder.rst:9 8051261487ff41aea9327d5536806097
msgid ""
"The PPM encoder allows to encode up to 8 PWM (pulse width modulated) signals"
" into one PPM (pulse position modulation) signal."
